# alab/merge-attributes — merge attributes for alab/sync.sh's upstream merges only: sync.sh
# passes this file as core.attributesFile to those commands, so no other merge in a clone
# sees it.
#
# codex-rs/Cargo.lock is derived data. When both sides changed it, upstream's side wins
# (the alab-upstream driver sync.sh defines), and sync.sh re-resolves it for ALab's crates
# before committing, refusing if that moves any package upstream locked.
codex-rs/Cargo.lock merge=alab-upstream
